OL,3,ASpanish transport minister resigns days
OL,4,Aafter deadly train crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpain's Transport Minister Oscar Puente
OL,7,Fhas resigned - six days after the
OL,8,Fhigh-speed train collision in which at
OL,9,Fleast 69 people were killed and dozens
OL,10,Finjured.
OL,12,FHe announced his decision in Congress,
OL,13,Fafter giving evidence on last
OL,14,FWednesday's disaster near the town of
OL,15,FUrda, south of the capital Madrid, in
OL,16,Fwhich a train smashed into the back of
OL,17,Fa stationary train.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
